sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest as Guest User
    participant App as Web App / UI
    participant Server as App Backend
    participant Paystack as Paystack API
    participant Resend as Resend API
    participant Google as Google Workspace

    %% 1. Reservation Confirmation
    Guest->>App: Submits booking reservation
    App->>Server: POST /api/reservations
    Server->>Resend: Send Confirmation Email
    Note over Resend: FROM: reservations@<br/>mail.reliefhotelsandsuites.com<br/>Reply-To: reservations@<br/>reliefhotelsandsuites.com
    Resend-->>Guest: Deliver Confirmation Email

    %% 2. Payment Receipt
    Guest->>App: Initiates payment checkout
    App->>Paystack: Redirect / Open Modal
    Guest->>Paystack: Completes transaction
    Paystack-->>Guest: Success response on UI

    Paystack->>Server: Webhook: charge.success
    Note over Server: Verify signature &<br/>update DB to Paid

    Server->>Resend: Send Payment Receipt
    Note over Resend: FROM: finance@<br/>mail.reliefhotelsandsuites.com<br/>Reply-To: finance@<br/>reliefhotelsandsuites.com<br/>BCC: finance@<br/>reliefhotelsandsuites.com

    Resend-->>Guest: Deliver Payment Receipt
    Resend-->>Google: Forward BCC copy to finance@ Group